description:
Number of new ART clients with baseline CD4 &lt;200 who tested positive for TB LAM and were started on TB treatment during the reporting period.
Criteria
The client must:
- be a new ART client during the reporting period;
- have baseline CD4 &lt;200;
- not be a transfer-in;
- have a positive TB-LAM result from either test results or the HIV ART Card; and
- have evidence of TB treatment initiation during the reporting period.
